Type over a selection (flushtyping+cut), then move right and press escape,
covering the right-arrow and escape branches of the typing handler.

-- input --
type hello world
move 25 5
button 1
move 35 5
button 0
type X
key right
key esc
move 50 5
button 1
button 0
